30","kind":"update","title":"Exciting Updated Demo + October Dev Update","summary":"Updated Demo! 🎊Our updated demo is live right now! Huge thanks to everyone for the feedback that shaped it 💛What's new in the new demo New areas to explore + brand new content Shop for clothes + salonNew mini games & moreQuality of Life improvementsHold the pet button while walking and you'll pet every animal you passA heart and paw above each animal show who's been petted and walked today, and bins show their fill levelPerformance pass (faster loading times everywhere)Controller and Steam Deck ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T18:08:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692057","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:24Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2262630-1841579228672490","game_id":"steam-2262630","kind":"announcement","title":"Beta Round 2 Sign Ups Open + August Development Updates","summary":"Hi friends!Hope you've been having a great summer! Some updates from us: BetaSign ups for our second round of beta testing are now open! As with the first round, active beta testers keep their copy of the game at launch, get their name in the credits, plus our eternal gratitude 💛 Join our Discord to apply or just to say hi: discord.gg/vvpAhGRcfVKeys for this round start going out in the next two days or so! If you already signed up for the first round, you don't need to sign up again! Developmen","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-23T00:35:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228672490","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:24Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2262630-1840310314342714","game_id":"steam-2262630","kind":"announcement","title":"Our Demo is back!","summary":"Hey friends!DemoSo excited to share that an updated demo for Wish Upon A Llama is available on Steam as part of both the Six One Indies Fest and the Wholesome Games Celebration! It covers the first 3 in game days and gives you a taste of life in Llama Town. Meet the townsfolk, befriend your first animals, and start making the town feel like home. This version also includes a ton of improvements based on your incredible feedback from our last demo, including new accessibility options (an option t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-06T17:39:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314342714","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:24Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2262630-1838407329262596","game_id":"steam-2262630","kind":"announcement","title":"Beta Sign Ups Open + We Have a Discord!","summary":"Hi friends! Super excited to share that we have a brand new discord server, and Beta sign ups are now open! Join our new discord here: https://discord.gg/vvpAhGRcfV, to sign up for Beta or just to say hi! Active beta testers keep their copy of the game at launch, get their name in the credits, plus our eternal gratitude! What's nextActively tackling bugs, the game is deep in polish. Discord is where news gets to you the fastest - including future beta waves, so we would love to see you there!Tha","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-18T20:56:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329262596","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:24Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2262630-1834602721192702","game_id":"steam-2262630","kind":"announcement","title":"New Demo Available + Platform and Publisher Announcements!","summary":"Extended Demo is live now! Our updated & extended demo is live on Steam right now, as announced in the first issue of lookingfor.game today! A huge thank you to Lucy James and Geoff Keighley for featuring us, it's a big honor.This time around, you’ll be able to play a full week in Llama Town, which gives you a chance to befriend more animals, meet more townsfolk, and unlock new areas to explore.Platforms & Consoles We’re excited to announce that Wish Upon A Llama is coming to: Steam (PC & Mac)Pl","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-06T00:47:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721192702","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:24Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2262630-1830163047261487","game_id":"steam-2262630","kind":"update","title":"April 2026 Development Update","summary":"April 2026 Development UpdateHi friends! Hope you're all doing well! We have some exciting news to share, along with updates on what we've been working on.New demo and beta testing coming soon!We'll be delivering a new demo experience and kicking off beta testing in Q2! We'll share timing and signup details as we get closer, we can't wait for you to try it!We're skipping Early Access and going straight to a full release in late 2026We were previously targeting a Q2 Early Access window, but after","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-17T22:04:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047261487","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:24Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2262630-1824644522844138","game_id":"steam-2262630","kind":"announcement","title":"February 2026 Development Updates","summary":"Hello friends! Hope you're all having a great weekend! We really appreciate your support and patience - it means so much to us. Here's what we've been working on for Wish Upon A Llama:Discord is coming! We'll be kicking off a Discord server soon and will share the invite link with this group as soon as it's ready.Character dialogue overhaul: We've been refining character dialogue to make the romance and marriage systems feel more natural and emotionally satisfying. See our updated character port","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-15T22:00:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1824644522844138","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:24Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2262630-5582843074953334314","game_id":"steam-2262630","kind":"announcement","title":"February Development Updates","summary":"Hello friends! Hope you’re all having a great start to February! Your support means so much to us and we wanted to share development updates on some cool things we've been working on for Wish Upon A Llama: We started a Twitter page! Check us out! here A visual makeover for numerous buildings and areas An improved placement system We’re working on our website New breedable pets (thank you all for the wonderful animal ideas)! We’ve shared the capybara already and will be sharing the other new anim","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-02-04T23:50:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5582843074953334314","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:24Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-2262630":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:52:56Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:52:56Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-2262630":"2026-10-26T09:52:56Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"2262630":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:52:56Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:52:56Z","status":"ok","error_code